  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14151668/assets/f7a8d632deb19af6f7efc30182fb349f766c3ca7c10ba6567f9e2fd2e02e4b07.png)\n\nWhich inequality corresponds to the highlighted region shown on the number line above?",
